" autocomplete="new-password"></label><button>Reset password</button></form></article><?php endforeach ?><h2>Core settings</h2><form method="post"><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="settings"><label>Passing percentage<input type="number" name="pass_percent" min="1" max="100" value="<?=e($config['pass_percent'])?>" required></label><button>Save passing score</button></form><p>Brand, grade range, support and required projects: config/app.php (override in ignored config/local.php).</p><h2>Lesson access</h2><?php foreach($lessons as $l):$enabled=!query('SELECT 1 FROM access WHERE lesson=? AND enabled=0',[$l['slug']])->fetchColumn();?><form method="post"><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="access"><input type="hidden" name="lesson" value="<?=e($l['slug'])?>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <?=$enabled?'checked':''?>><?=e($l['title'])?></label><button>Update access</button></form><?php endforeach ?><h2>Teacher model answers</h2><p>Speed: lower PWM can prevent starting, so compare observations. Sensor reporter: use millis with an unsigned timestamp. Initial lastTurn=-1 searches left; +1 searches right. Obstacle right preference: when both sides clear set turnSign=+1, while preserving blocked-side checks. Never remove the deadman for convenience.</p></div><?php endif ?></main></div><?php endif ?></body></html>
